{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-12-14 09:59:00', 'title': "STANLEY BLACK & DECKER RECOGNIZED WITH CDP'S DOUBLE 'A' SCORE FOR GLOBAL CLIMATE AND WATER STEWARDSHIP", 'text': 'NEW BRITAIN, CONN., DEC. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR ITS LEADERSHIP IN CLIMATE ACTION AND WATER SECURITY BY GLOBAL ENVIRONMENTAL NON-PROFIT CDP.'}